        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 98050,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, it's time to plan our pilot (T10). I've spoken with sales management, and they've proposed 'Innovate Corp' as our first pilot customer. They are friendly, patient, and their project size is typical. I suggest we aim to start their onboarding in one week, on next Monday. What are your thoughts?",
